        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Build a four-neighbor connected wall of Mechanical Crafters, all facing the same direction and in one plane. This real crushing-wheel recipe uses a 5x5 shape without its four corners: 21 crafters.",
            "zh_cn": "先搭同朝向、同一平面、上下左右连通的动力合成器墙。本例是真实粉碎轮配方：5×5 去掉四角，共 21 格。"
          },
          "point": [
            4.5,
            5.8,
            4.5
          ],
          "duration": 130,
          "color": "blue",
          "placeNearTarget": false,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 140},
        {"type": "highlight_section", "blockPos": [7, 3, 4], "color": "green", "duration": 110, "blockPos2": [7, 3, 5]},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Power the integrated cogwheels through an adjacent cogwheel. A shaft or motor directly behind a crafter is not a shaft connection. Neighboring gears rotate in opposite directions, as shown.",
            "zh_cn": "动力从相邻齿轮啮合传入。合成器背面不是可直连的轴端，不能把马达或传动杆直接贴背面当作接好动力；相邻齿轮按图交替反转。"
          },
          "point": [
            7.5,
            3.8,
            4.5
          ],
          "duration": 130,
          "color": "blue",
          "placeNearTarget": false,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 140},
        {"type": "show_line", "point": [1.5, 3.5, 4.5], "point2": [2.5, 3.5, 4.5], "color": "input", "duration": 90},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": {
            "en_us": "The provider must touch a crafter and have its target face point at that block. ALL has no target. It can recognize the connected wall from that one entrance; no G scan or linker selection is required for the front group.",
            "zh_cn": "供应器必须紧贴一格合成器，目标面指向它；ALL 没有目标。它会从这一格识别同朝向连通墙，正面这一组无需链接器，也不用按 G 扫描。"
          },
          "point": [
            1.5,
            3.8,
            4.5
          ],
          "duration": 135,
          "color": "blue",
          "placeNearTarget": false,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 145},
        {"type": "show_controls", "action": "right", "point": [1.5, 3.8, 4.5], "direction": "down", "duration": 45},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Encode an AE2 PROCESSING pattern, not a normal crafting pattern: 16 Andesite Alloy + 4 matching Planks + 1 matching Stone -> 2 Crushing Wheels. The adapter obtains the large layout from the real recipe; do not force it into a 3x3 pattern.",
            "zh_cn": "在 AE2 编码为处理样板，而非普通合成样板：16 安山合金＋4 份符合配方的木板＋1 份石头 → 2 粉碎轮。适配器从真实配方还原大网格，不用硬塞进 3×3。"
          },
          "point": [
            1.5,
            3.8,
            4.5
          ],
          "duration": 150,
          "color": "blue",
          "placeNearTarget": false,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {"type": "idle", "duration": 160},
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": {
            "en_us": "After a valid job passes planning, the provider arranges the required arrows and shared input groups and supplies each recipe cell. You do not need to hand-turn every arrow or merge inputs first.",
            "zh_cn": "任务规划通过后，供应器会安排所需箭头、合并输入组，并给各配方格供料。无需先手动扳完所有箭头，也不用预先手动合并输入。"
          },
          "point": [
            4.5,
            3.8,
            4.5
          ],
          "duration": 125,
          "color": "blue",
          "placeNearTarget": false,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
