          "type": "text",
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Here the provider touches the edge IN the wall plane, so it can also receive the final product directly. This is different from a provider touching only the wall front or back.",
            "zh_cn": "本图供应器位于合成器墙平面内的边缘，最终成品可直接送入供应器回网。仅贴在墙正面或背面时，不能沿这个方向直接出货。"
