        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Keep ingredient cells uncovered and empty. Matching normal crafting-table recipes depend on Create server settings. If the wall is too small, disconnected, unpowered or occupied, check the specific Goggles/Jade rejection reason.",
